        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yanki brothers in the house! Take one new generation of Yankis, 12 members strong, fighting and flaunting their 'tudes, add in two entirely new game systems, and you get a sick beat 'em up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Renmaru Mido punches and kicks his way into that den of delinquents known as Doshu High School,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is he destined to become a legend, or to go down as just another martyr?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't some plain old belt scroller where you and a buddy fight against Yanki hordes. This is a totally evolved, sick beat 'em up, baby!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Hot! Super stylin' fighting action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clobber Yankis using 10 Special Moves, not to mention kicking and punching, running, and defending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/66216892697ebd454446ed4d0be287d3.poster.avif?t=1782115954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/66216892697ebd454446ed4d0be287d3.webm?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/66216892697ebd454446ed4d0be287d3.mp4?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Screamin' Hot! No limit to strength with the fighting-mahjong system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mahjong-themed system that punctuates each fight can strengthen your Yanki abilities and base actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go wild with constantly evolving hyper-fighting action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/fd152b48022914fb8035b72b129fbe97.poster.avif?t=1782115954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/fd152b48022914fb8035b72b129fbe97.webm?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/fd152b48022914fb8035b72b129fbe97.mp4?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Smokin'! A buddy to the rescue with partner slots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On-screen partner slots start spinning when the fighting tension begins to rise! When it stops, your partner comes to help, taking the role it lands on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/61c2c07a5b7e8a16e1ce41b523e6cea3.poster.avif?t=1782115954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/61c2c07a5b7e8a16e1ce41b523e6cea3.webm?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/61c2c07a5b7e8a16e1ce41b523e6cea3.mp4?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■On fire! An alias advertising an attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cool to ridiculous and everything in between--slap on an alias to exponentially evolve your abilities and take your strength to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.poster.avif?t=1782115954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.webm?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.mp4?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■I'm burnin' up! Join the struggle brother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't like action, Player Two can have fun backing up their buddy at the partner slots and show them some brotherly love!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live streams and gameplay videos? Bring it on!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We permit monetization through video streaming and live broadcasts using this game.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yanki brothers in the house! Take one new generation of Yankis, 12 members strong, fighting and flaunting their 'tudes, add in two entirely new game systems, and you get a sick beat 'em up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Renmaru Mido punches and kicks his way into that den of delinquents known as Doshu High School,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is he destined to become a legend, or to go down as just another martyr?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't some plain old belt scroller where you and a buddy fight against Yanki hordes. This is a totally evolved, sick beat 'em up, baby!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Hot! Super stylin' fighting action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clobber Yankis using 10 Special Moves, not to mention kicking and punching, running, and defending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/66216892697ebd454446ed4d0be287d3.poster.avif?t=1782115954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/66216892697ebd454446ed4d0be287d3.webm?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/66216892697ebd454446ed4d0be287d3.mp4?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Screamin' Hot! No limit to strength with the fighting-mahjong system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mahjong-themed system that punctuates each fight can strengthen your Yanki abilities and base actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go wild with constantly evolving hyper-fighting action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas