ps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.poster.avif?t=1782115954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.webm?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2911070/extras/1c7518e4291e1632f4204c271d479eb1.mp4?t=1782115954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■I'm burnin' up! Join the struggle brother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don't like action, Player Two can have fun backing up their buddy at the partner slots and show them some brotherly love!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live streams and gameplay videos? Bring it on!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We permit monetization through video streaming and live broadcasts using this game.</p>",
